    {
      "displayText": "嗨，我问你呀！在宝可梦对战时，\n要是能一边攻击一边回复HP该多好！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你有没有这样想过？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55E8FF0C621195EE4F605440FF0157285B9D53EF68A65BF9621865F6FF0C000A8981662F80FD4E008FB9653B51FB4E008FB956DE590D004800508BE5591A597DFF0100100001BE00000A4F6067096CA167098FD9683760F38FC7FF1F00100002011401520000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用吸取HP的招式就能实现哦！\n每次攻击都能回复HP！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7528543853D600480050768462DB5F0F5C3180FD5B9E73B054E6FF01000A6BCF6B21653B51FB90FD80FD56DE590D00480050FF0100100002011401520000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "自己的宝可梦被吸取HP！\n而对手的宝可梦却会回复HP！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你想不想尝尝这恐怖的滋味？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "81EA5DF176845B9D53EF68A688AB543853D600480050FF01000A800C5BF9624B76845B9D53EF68A653744F1A56DE590D00480050FF0100100001BE00000A4F6060F34E0D60F35C1D5C1D8FD96050601676846ECB5473FF1F00100002011401520000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
